#: ../../source/docs/sprayer.rst:5 e5a3637c01794ffe8363a7ff11e4c040
msgid "Crop Sprayer"
msgstr "农药喷洒器"

#: ../../source/docs/sprayer.rst:7 6b588682c2de4d7c820f3194f6700d62
msgid ""
"Copter includes support for a crop sprayer.  This feature allows an "
"autopilot connected to a PWM operated pump and (optionally) spinner to "
"control the rate of flow of liquid fertilizer based on the vehicle speed."
msgstr "Copter 支持农药喷洒器功能。该功能允许飞控连接 PWM 控制的泵（可选连接旋转雾化器），根据飞行器速度控制液体肥料的流量。"

#: ../../source/docs/sprayer.rst:12 5ef6d68ff72e424983486b28500d078a
msgid ""
"Slightly out-of-date video showing a copter using the Sprayer feature (jump "
"to 2:25 to see the sprayer in action)."
msgstr "略有过时的视频，展示了使用喷洒器功能的飞机（跳至 2:25 可看到喷洒器运行）。"

#: ../../source/docs/sprayer.rst:14 a21116688eb9402584d193edc65a50ec
msgid ""
"Many boards with only 1MB of flash do not have this feature. See "
":ref:`Firmware Limitations <common-limited_firmware>` for a list of boards "
"without this capability."
msgstr ""
"许多仅有 1MB 闪存的板子不具备此功能。请参阅 :ref:`固件限制 <common-limited_firmware>` "
"获取不具备此功能的板子列表。"

#: ../../source/docs/sprayer.rst:16 3363a5e9d2dd411e868e08e50a710147
msgid "See also :ref:`Zig-Zag Mode <zigzag-mode>`"
msgstr "另见 :ref:`ZigZag 模式 <zigzag-mode>`"

#: ../../source/docs/sprayer.rst:19 f7f48b4856e6477e8fa998df44133add
msgid "Required Hardware"
msgstr "所需硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/sprayer.rst:24 3b72d4c68acc4107b0db474cf2b595f4
msgid ""
"A multicopter such as the `EnRoute AC 940-D "
"<https://www.nttedt.co.jp/product?pgid=knya72d0-00609f8a-0b97-4818-be16-4d03a6ebf88a>`_"
" with a PWM controlled pump and optionally a PWM controlled spinning "
"mechanism (EnRoute vehicle does not require this secondary spinner control)."
msgstr ""
"一架多旋翼（如 `EnRoute AC 940-D "
"<https://www.nttedt.co.jp/product?pgid=knya72d0-00609f8a-0b97-4818-be16-4d03a6ebf88a>`_），配备"
" PWM 控制的泵，以及可选的 PWM 控制旋转机构（EnRoute 飞行器不需要此辅助旋转器控制）。"

#: ../../source/docs/sprayer.rst:26 ca372d801548437f8cac9354a07072fb
msgid "The pump controls the rate of flow of the fertilizer."
msgstr "泵控制肥料的流量。"

#: ../../source/docs/sprayer.rst:28 460c1e50a23d4861865fd97d6931a3a2
msgid ""
"The optional spinner (rotary atomizer) should be attached to the end of the "
"spraying nozzles and enables control over spray droplet size. Higher PWM, "
"faster rotation, smaller droplets."
msgstr "可选的旋转雾化器应安装在喷嘴末端，用于控制喷雾液滴大小。PWM 越高，转速越快，液滴越小。"

#: ../../source/docs/sprayer.rst:31 655a9adb1bcc4662a8b9b97076bc228e
msgid "Enabling the Sprayer"
msgstr "启用喷洒器"

#: ../../source/docs/sprayer.rst:33 3a5980337f8f4df2948cc76cbd28ce77
msgid "Connect your autopilot to the ground station (i.e. Mission Planner)"
msgstr "将飞控连接到地面站（即 Mission Planner）"

#: ../../source/docs/sprayer.rst:34 a720719446b6436eade9d329d6f41b2a
msgid ""
"Set the :ref:`SPRAY_ENABLE <SPRAY_ENABLE>` parameter to 1 and refresh "
"parameters (the sprayer is not a commonly used feature so its other "
"parameters are initially hidden)"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`SPRAY_ENABLE <SPRAY_ENABLE>` 参数设置为 1 并刷新参数（喷洒器不是常用功能，其他参数最初是隐藏的）"

#: ../../source/docs/sprayer.rst:35 62200b253a2641acb71f8477010595d5
msgid ""
"Connect the pump to one of the autopilot's PWM outputs (like Pixhawk AUX1) "
"and set the appropriate SERVO*_FUNCTION  or RC*_FUNCTION to 22 (where \"*\" "
"is the RC output number, i.e. if the pump is connected to a Pixhawk's AUX1, "
"set :ref:`SERVO9_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>` to 22)."
msgstr ""
"将泵连接到飞控的某个 PWM 输出（如 Pixhawk AUX1），并将相应的 SERVO *_FUNCTION 或 RC* _FUNCTION 设置为"
" 22（其中\"*\"为 RC 输出编号，例如若泵连接到 Pixhawk 的 AUX1，则将 :ref:`SERVO9_FUNCTION "
"<SERVO9_FUNCTION>` 设置为 22）。"

#: ../../source/docs/sprayer.rst:36 884e6a9e2d2b4116ba4644f7cb608ea7
msgid ""
"Connect the optional spinner to another output port and set SERVO*_FUNCTION "
"or RC*_FUNCTION to 23 (i.e. if using a Pixhawk's AUX2, set "
":ref:`SERVO10_FUNCTION <SERVO10_FUNCTION>` to 23)"
msgstr ""
"将可选的旋转雾化器连接到另一个输出端口，并将 SERVO *_FUNCTION 或 RC* _FUNCTION 设置为 23（例如，若使用 "
"Pixhawk 的 AUX2，则将 :ref:`SERVO10_FUNCTION <SERVO10_FUNCTION>` 设置为 23）"

#: ../../source/docs/sprayer.rst:37 523c06bb2da744a4a694296f4269e388
msgid ""
"To allow the pilot to turn on/off the sprayer set an auxiliary switch on an "
"rc channel(``RCx_OPTION``) to \"15\""
msgstr "若要允许飞手开关喷洒器，将某个 RC 通道的辅助开关（``RCx_OPTION``）设置为\"15\""

#: ../../source/docs/sprayer.rst:40 ec6ce58cc82c4512bebba0710b569737
msgid "Configuring the pump"
msgstr "配置泵"

#: ../../source/docs/sprayer.rst:41 63657b7113d949ecb73176d91d4c7e16
msgid ""
"PWM range used to control the pump and spinner can be configured by setting "
"the SERVO*_MIN/RC*_MIN, SERVO*_MAX/RC*_MAX parameters corresponding to the "
"pwm output channels the pump and spinner are connected to."
msgstr ""
"用于控制泵和旋转雾化器的 PWM 范围，可通过设置泵和旋转雾化器所连接的 PWM 输出通道对应的 "
"SERVO*_MIN/RC*_MIN、SERVO*_MAX/RC*_MAX 参数进行配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/sprayer.rst:42 d5a3f2a978af4b4bab7736b4bdff6ba1
msgid ""
":ref:`SPRAY_PUMP_MIN <SPRAY_PUMP_MIN>` controls the minimum pump rate "
"(expressed as a percentage).  By default this is 0% meaning the pump will "
"completely stop if the vehicle stops."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SPRAY_PUMP_MIN <SPRAY_PUMP_MIN>` 控制泵的最小转速（以百分比表示）。默认值为 "
"0%，表示飞行器停止时泵将完全停止。"

#: ../../source/docs/sprayer.rst:43 f484eb6003e04af18ba2cef049ec1acc
msgid ""
":ref:`SPRAY_PUMP_RATE <SPRAY_PUMP_RATE>` controls the pump rate (expressed "
"as a percentage) when the vehicle is travelling at 1m/s.  By default this is"
" 10%.  The pump rate increases linearly with the vehicle speed meaning by "
"default the pump will reach 100% at 10m/s."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SPRAY_PUMP_RATE <SPRAY_PUMP_RATE>` 控制飞行器以 1m/s 行进时的泵转速（以百分比表示）。默认值为 "
"10%。泵转速随飞行器速度线性增加，默认情况下飞行器速度达到 10m/s 时泵将达到 100%。"

#: ../../source/docs/sprayer.rst:44 3d2b28ab4d3a420e87f3d672b34269ee
msgid ""
":ref:`SPRAY_SPINNER <SPRAY_SPINNER>` sets the pwm value sent to the spinner "
"when the pump is on."
msgstr ":ref:`SPRAY_SPINNER <SPRAY_SPINNER>` 设置泵开启时发送给旋转雾化器的 PWM 值。"

#: ../../source/docs/sprayer.rst:45 0959a2a1385540f7a82df439cc5e13fa
msgid ""
":ref:`SPRAY_SPEED_MIN <SPRAY_SPEED_MIN>` sets the minimum vehicle speed (in "
"cm/s) at which the pump will operate.  Default is 100 meaning the pump will "
"begin when the vehicle is travelling at or above 1m/s."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SPRAY_SPEED_MIN <SPRAY_SPEED_MIN>` 设置泵工作的最低飞行器速度（单位：cm/s）。默认值为 "
"100，表示飞行器速度达到或超过 1m/s 时泵才开始工作。"
